n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Fedora Linux 41 (KDE Plasma) - X11 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (nvidia; 565.57.01) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900K (32 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe Default Project Path editor setting acts incorrectly if it ends in a trailing slash. This can happen if you manually enter or paste a path from elsewhere, so we should ensure both act identical by stripping the trailing slash when reading the setting if it's there.\n\n### Default Project Path = `/home/hugo/Documents/Godot`\n\n*No trailing slash.*\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0b8fc81-4578-4bbc-9bb7-2b34814bfc75)\n\n\n### Default Project Path = `/home/hugo/Documents/Godot/`\n\n*With trailing slash. Notice how there's one extra folder component which isn't desired here.*\n\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/780b677b-c606-46ca-8205-bb09e46f3846)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Set Default Project Path editor setting to a value that ends with a trailing slash. You can do this by manually entering the slash in the path (without using the Browse icon on the right).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"h